#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:33
msgid ""
"On this page, you can select an image that will be displayed behind the "
"chart. You can also select whether the image should be scaled or centered"
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:43
msgid ""
"You can select a background image from this list. Initially, the installed "
"KDE wallpapers will be offered. If you do not find what you are looking for "
"here, you can select any image file by clicking on the <i>Browse</i> button "
"below."
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:50
#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:128 kchartParameterPieConfigPage.cc:33
msgid "None"
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:59
msgid "&Browse..."
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:60
msgid ""
"Click this button to select a background image not yet present in the list "
"above. "
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:66
msgid ""
"This area will always display the currently selected background image. Note "
"that the image will be scaled and thus might have a different ratio than it "
"originally had."
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:77
msgid ""
"In this box, you can set various settings that control how the background "
"image is displayed."
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:84
#, c-format
msgid "&Intensity in %"
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:87
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can select how much the image should be brightened up so that it "
"does not disturb the chart itself too much.<br> Different images require "
"different settings, but 25% is a good value to start with."
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:95
msgid "Scaled"
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:96
msgid ""
"If you check this box, the selected image will be scaled to fit the total "
"chart size."
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:99
msgid "Centered"
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:100
msgid ""
"If you check this box, the selected image will be centered over the chart. "
"If the image is larger then the chart, you will only see the middle part of "
"it.<br> This setting is only available if the <i>Scaled</i> checkbox is not "
"checked."
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:197
msgid "Currently only local wallpapers are allowed."
msgstr ""

